ce profile, a shared region cluster, or another customer's fraud; the pattern is coordinated or undocumented (rule R9). A report always has a case behind it. Most cases never need a report. The report narrative must stand on its own: who, what, when, where, how, and why it is suspicious. Deciding correctly between \"\"case only\"\" and \"\"case plus report\"\" is part of the next-best-action score.","source":"fraud_policy","authority":"bank"}]}},"evidence_held":["query:alert_context(tx=3435476)","query:card_window(card=C00854-K2, 2016-10-27..2016-11-06)","query:holder_history(holder=C00854-K2|299|127, before=2016-11-06)","query:device_neighbors(device=D000255, 2016-10-07..2016-11-06)","query:shared_origin(tx=3435476, window=+/-7d)","query:linked_cases(tx=3435476)","query:similar_closed_cases(\"risk score: Monitoring: transaction 3435476 ($149.99) on car...\", k=6)","query:ring_members(ring=37749036)","query:community_profile(card=C00854-K2)","query:ring_members(ring=33554757)","query:policy_search(\"card_not_present_new_device requirements and definition\")","query:card_window(card=C00854-K2, 2016-11-06..2016-11-06)","query:card_window(card=C00854-K2, 2016-11-05..2016-11-06)","query:device_neighbors(device=D005906, 2016-10-07..2016-11-06)","query:policy_sections(section=Section 3a. A case is not a report)"],"probability":0.205},{"step":20,"at":"2026-09-24 12:00:49","kind":"evidence","detail":"query:policy_sections(section=Rule R6: Shared origin)","tool":"policy_rule","query":"policy_sections","parameters":"section=Rule R6: Shared origin","returned":{"passages":{"count":1,"first":[{"ref":"query:policy_sections(section=Rule R6: Shared origin)","section":"Rule R6: Shared origin","text":"Rule R6: Shared origin. When several cards show fraud from the same device profile, the same billing region, or the same recipient email in one window, name the shared element, recommend `CREATE_CASE` and `FILE_REPORT`, and `MONITOR_CONNECTED_CARDS` for every card that shares it.","sour